] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[clamp(5rem,15vw,14rem)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.06em] text-white/[0.035]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\">PEOPLE</p><div class=\"absolute left-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 hidden h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-white/[0.03] lg:block\"></div></div><div class=\"container-shell relative flex min-h-[calc(72vh-5rem)] flex-col justify-between py-16 md:py-20 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr] lg:gap-20\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-24px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px bg-gold\" style=\"width:0px\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.28em] text-brand-200\">OUR PEOPLE</p></div></div><div><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><h1 class=\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.045em] text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl\" style=\"transform:translateY(110%)\">認識我們的團隊</h1></div><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/55 md:text-lg md:leading-9\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">來自不同背景與專業領域的夥伴，在交流、協作與實務累積中彼此學習，一起建立屬於好天使的團隊文化。</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 flex items-end justify-between border-t border-white/10 pt-5\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.24em] text-white/40\">GOOD ANGEL</span><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold/60\"></span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.24em] text-white/40\">TAICHUNG · TAIWAN</span></div><span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">03</span></div></div></section><section id=\"team\" class=\"overflow-hidden bg-ivory text-brand-900\"><div class=\"container-shell py-24 md:py-32 lg:py-40\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-20\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px bg-gold\" style=\"width:0px\"></span><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">OUR PEOPLE</p></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">People · Knowledge<br/>Collaboration · Growth</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\"><h2 class=\"max-w-5xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.045em] md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl\">每一份專業背後，<br/>都是一群願意<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> 一起前進的人。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-muted md:text-lg md:leading-9\">好天使匯聚不同經驗與專業背景的夥伴。我們相信，好的團隊不是每個人都一樣， 而是讓不同能力彼此交流、互相學習，一起把事情做好。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto h-[70vh] min-h-[560px] max-h-[900px] w-full overflow-hidden\" style=\"clip-path:inset(10% 8% 10% 8%)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"transform:scale(1.1)\"><img alt=\"好天使團隊文化\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-center\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhero-team.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-900/20\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-2/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-900 via-brand-900/35 to-transparent\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.08]\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(1,43,81,.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(1,43,81,.5) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:80px 80px\"></div><div class=\"container-shell absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-10 pb-10 md:pb-14\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 border-t border-white/25 pt-6 md:flex-row md:items-end\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] text-gold\">TOGETHER WE GROW</p><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-xl text-2xl font-medium leading-[1.4] text-white md:text-4xl\">不只是一起工作，<br/>也是一起變得更好。</p></div><p class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.28em] text-white/50\">GOOD ANGEL / TEAM CULTURE</p></div></div></div><div class=\"container-shell py-24 md:py-32 lg:py-40\"><div class=\"mb-16 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 border-b border-brand-900/15 pb-10 md:flex-row md:items-end\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-gold\">MEET THE PEOPLE</p><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] md:text-5xl\">認識我們的夥伴</h3></div><p class=\"max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">不同背景、不同經驗，在同一個團隊裡分享彼此的專業與觀點。</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-x-6 gap-y-16 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:gap-x-8\"><article class=\"group \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(70px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-brand-100\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-600/50\">TEAM PORTRAIT</p><p class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-6xl text-brand-900/10\">01</p></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-900/0 transition-colors duration-700 group-hover:bg-brand-900/10\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.08]\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(1,43,81,.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(1,43,81,.5) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:48px 48px\"></div><span class=\"absolute left-5 top-5 text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/40\">01</span><div class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 flex h-11 w-11 translate-y-3 items-center justify-center bg-brand-900 text-ivory opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">↗︎</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[3px] w-0 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full\"></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-brand-900/15 pb-8 pt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">不動產實務與財商專業</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-1\">核心團隊</h3></div><span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-900/30\">GA /<!-- -->01</span></div><p class=\"mt-5 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">結合不動產市場經驗與財商思維，透過實務交流與案例分享，陪伴夥伴逐步建立自己的專業判斷能力。</p></div></article><article class=\"group lg:translate-y-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(70px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-brand-100\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-600/50\">TEAM PORTRAIT</p><p class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-6xl text-brand-900/10\">02</p></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-900/0 transition-colors duration-700 group-hover:bg-brand-900/10\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.08]\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(1,43,81,.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(1,43,81,.5) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:48px 48px\"></div><span class=\"absolute left-5 top-5 text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-900/40\">02</span><div class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 flex h-11 w-11 translate-y-3 items-center justify-center bg-brand-900 text-ivory opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">↗︎</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[3px] w-0 bg-gold transition-all duration-700 group-hover:w-full\"></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-brand-900/15 pb-8 pt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">學習交流與成長陪伴</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-1\">專業夥伴</h3></div><span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-900/30\">GA /<!-- -->02</span></div><p class=\"mt-5 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">來自不同背景與專業領域，在團隊協作、經驗分享與持續學習中彼此交流，一起累積屬於好天使的專業能力。</p></div></article></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-yellow\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-10 left-0 whitespace-nowrap text-[clamp(8rem,20vw,20rem)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.07em] text-brand-900/[0.035]\">TOGETHER</div><div class=\"container-shell relative py-24 md:py-32\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.55fr_1.45fr] lg:gap-20\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-900/60\" style=\"opacity:0\">OUR CULTURE</p><div><h3 class=\"max-w-5xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.045em] md:text-6xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)\">專業不是<br/>一個人的表現，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-700\">而是一群人一起累積的結果。</span></h3><div class=\"mt-12 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 border-t border-brand-900/20 pt-8 md:flex-row md:items-end\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-brand-900/65\">我們重視彼此分享經驗、交換觀點，也保留每個人發展自己專業方向的空間。 在這裡，學習不只是課程，而是每天與不同夥伴合作時持續發生的事情。</p><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-5 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-brand-900\" href=\"/team\"><span>認識團隊</span><span class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-2\">→︎</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-900 text-ivory\"><div class=\"h-px origin-left bg-gold/70\" style=\"transform:scaleX(0)\"></div><div class=\"container-shell relative\"><div class=\"grid gap-16 py-20 md:py-28 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] lg:gap-24\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><p class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] text-gold\">GOOD ANGEL / TAICHUNG</p><h2 class=\"mt-7 max-w-xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.25] tracking-[-0.04em] text-white md:text-5xl\">與願意成長的人，<br/><span class=\"text-brand-200\">一起走得更遠。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/45\">結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育， 與願意學習、願意成長的夥伴一起累積專業。</p><div class=\"mt-12 flex max-w-lg flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-4\"><span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-white/30\">REAL ESTATE</span><span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-white/30\">FINANCE</span><span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-white/30\">PEOPLE</span><span class=\"text-[9px] tracking-[0.25em] text-white/30\">GROWTH</span></div></div><nav class=\"border-t border-white/15\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(30px)\"><a class=\"group relative flex items-center justify-between overflow-hidden border-b border-white/15 py-5 md:py-6\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 origin-left scale-x-0 bg-white/[0.035] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></div><div class=\"relative flex items-center gap-6\"><span class=\"text-[8px] tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">01</span><span class=\"text-base font-medium text-white/65 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:text-white md:text-lg\">首頁</span></div><span class=\"relative text-lg text-white/25 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-gold\">↗︎</span></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(30px)\"><a class=\"group relativ